  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  campDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  Skills:
  - {fileID: 9215298321985235104}
  - {fileID: 3856204386270252114}
  - {fileID: 6841015270289900592}
  - {fileID: 3366094150535069251}
  - {fileID: 453045370577815044}
  - {fileID: 2747092750167023225}
  SkillInfo:
  - 'Slash an enemy for 3-10 damage. '
  - Protect Yael from harm for 3 turn.
  - Cleave all enemies for 5-20 damage. Enemies in the front take more.
  - Buff Yael's Berate and Heal effects.
  - Yael cannot be debuffed for 3 turns.
  - Enemies that attack Yael will recieve 5 damage.
  EdQuote:
  - Looks like she doesn't need help with that.
  - Yael is needed for the journey. Jasper should take her along.
  - Maybe Jasper needs to prove to Yael that she's stronger than she lets on.
  - Yael can be a great ally if Jasper will open up a bit more.
  - I hope Jasper sees Yael as a friend someday.
  - Both young adventurers. Yael doesn't deserve to be scarred so.
  YaQuote:
  - Well. That's my job.
  - A couple hits might knock her screws back into place.
  - There's not enough sunlight for this. I blame that damn Moonwalker.
  - 0
  - Such a spell isn't fit for her lack of finesse.
  - 'If she dies, she dies. '
  skillAvailable: 0
  skillBox: {fileID: 6266689473133682272}
  YQuote: {fileID: 1931366371536755489}
  EQuote: {fileID: 4193125150131952260}
